Pipa wants Ji Woo to be the one to seduce her as soon as the ward is gone. A business acquaintance who is closer to a stranger than a friend. Pipa isn't even considering what Carps' preferences might be.<br /> <br /> Both figures want something for her, will force it on her, and what she wants has not been taken in consideration. The only to really think about that has been Zane the J\u00faw\u00e0ir\u00e9n or outsider.<br /> <br /> Another way to look at it is Angel vs. Celebrant.<br /> <br /> Another question: Is Pipa's thing against virtue against virtue period, or those who laud their virtue to and above others?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T02:54:10-08:00","id":69723,"title":"","content":"While several members of the Band (Magnus, Andy, Ji-Woo) are pretty put off she does not have the choice, for Pipa Jing that was the selling point to get her currupted. Pipa Jing does not really care about Laughing Carp, beyond her being a saccharine annoyance. Anything that makes her stop being a saccharine annoyance is fine, but killing her would just lead to problems. Better to have someone else deal with it. Her first choice for seducer would be Jean, she likes Jean and figures he would just seduce her if possible (she is wrong, but her mistake is understandable, Jean is kinda a Rake). But she is not really offended at the situation, she is just making trouble, which is generally what Pipa Jing does.<br /> <br /> Zane wants to give her the choice regarding her destiny. She wants to take the pearl but offer it back. Rajani seems to have no POV on the matter (she is more fixated on violence anyway).<br /> <br /> To some degree against virtue period. In the Investiature of the Gods, she targeted pure heroes to attempt to trick or kill (usually through trickery, like the hearts thing). She does serve Da Ji, however, who serves Nu Wa (whose annoyance at the King was a major factor in Investiture of the Gods). The major reason she has not gone to the formless Hundon is she feels some loyalty to Nu Wa. Like White Snake (man, so many villainous women) she is kinda in an odd relationship with the CB.<br /> <br /> Does that make sense? She is pretty amoral, but has some sense of honor to her masters. I am not saying she is not a bad person she absolutely is. Just not really a hypocrite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 02-11-2014, 05:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T04:05:40-08:00","id":69738,"title":"","content":"Her method and apparent motivation makes it look hypocritical, but her actual motivation is worse. Interesting. Does Pipa follow the line of thought &quot;Virginity makes you stupid&quot;? That's the vibe i'm getting. I'm probably wrong though, or maybe that's Ji Woo's mentality?<br /> <br /> I get it. Loyalty would be her virtue. Also, complete chaos would probably be as much of a detriment to her as rigid law and hierarchy. She needs something to flounce.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T11:55:05-08:00","id":69938,"title":"","content":"The only real Virginity related issues has been Zane and Laughing Carps proclaiming how relationships and Virginity work making them look foolish. Zane feels that the boyfriend gives the girlfriend presents in exchange for sex, and takes care of them (again, in exchange for sex) and is unafraid to lecture people (who have had/are in relationships) about how that works despite having no firsthand experience. Ji-Woo's problem is her lifestyle sort of backs it up, though others do not (Magnus has gotten gifts from female admirers, for instance, which Zane chooses to ignore) LC views sex in terms of reproduction, does not understand homosexuality at all, and has the POV that as a Dragon she does not really need a mate as she is long lived. PJ mostly does not like Laughing Carp, and her childlike worldview is a low hanging fruit. It is also the easiest to goad someone in to dealing with. If she becomes indolent then she is not on PJ's case.<br /> <br /> PJ's virtues are Conviction, Malice, Rapacity, and Vengance. She has little ambition thus no Ambition, and no real loyalty to the Titans thus no Zealotry. She is less a rebel more a dark creature...more Kalfu then Nezha, but even Kalfu is an evil god on the god's side in the war, which is more or less where Pipa Jing is.Da Ji is arguably more evil in the sense of less filial loyalty. PJ is loyal to Da Ji, but Da Ji has also essentially resurrected her a few times, so that will do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href